00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:25.620
to ensure that they live well now,

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.310
and decades into the future.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:29.537
Not just living longer, but
living much better as well.

00:05:29.537 --> 00:05:32.000
- And this includes for
low and no cost at all.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.900
These are things people
can actually implement

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:35.488
in their lives right now.

00:05:35.488 --> 00:05:38.450
- Right, so future episodes
