00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:49.890
And some of the supplements
we'll talk about and treatments,

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:52.580
and even medicines, are relatively cheap.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.600
So this isn't for billionaires,

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.850
